Third-party components

Fenix Spoon (https://github.com/mandaloriat/fenix-spoon) is MIT-licensed and is
used here as a dependency and as a container base image. Its browser packages
are built from source and served from `frontend/vendor/`; their license travels
with them.

FEniCSx components (DOLFINx, UFL, FFCx, Basix) are LGPL-3.0-or-later and are
used as external dependencies inside the container images published by the
Fenix Spoon project. They are not redistributed by this repository.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to the FEniCS
Project. "FEniCS", "FEniCSx" and "DOLFINx" are used only to state, factually,
which software performs the computations.
